{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20231","headline":"峡哀 七 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡棱剸日月，日月多摧辉。\n物皆斜仄生，鸟亦斜仄飞。\n潜石齿相锁，沉魂招莫归。\n恍惚清泉甲，斑斓碧石衣。\n饿咽潺湲号，涎似泓浤肥。\n峡青不可游，腥草生微微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}